<title>UK: Credit Local sets 2.0 bln FFR 15-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 2.0 bln FFR 15-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    20.AUG.12</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.55    PAY DATE    20.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  3.00	REOFFER    99.00     SPREAD	+19 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10-100    LISTING    PAR/LUX   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.45	SELL CONC  2.55	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.50 PCT 2011 OAT / 8.50 PCT 2012 OAT -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
